msgid ""
"Critical **runtime** paths in this tree. Channel states (`CS_*`) and the "
"state-handler contract are in [Architecture](01-architecture.md); ESL "
"commands, events, and SQL tables are in [Data and API](04-data-and-"
"api.md). Default inbound progression after create: `CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` →"
" `CS_ROUTING` → `CS_EXECUTE` → media or hangup `CS_HANGUP` → "
"`CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY` (`src/include/switch_types.h`)."
msgstr ""
"本仓库中的关键 **运行时** 路径。通道状态（`CS_*`）与状态处理约定见 [架构](02-architecture.md)；ESL "
"命令、事件和 SQL 表见 [数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md)。创建后的默认呼入推进：`CS_NEW` → "
"`CS_INIT` → `CS_ROUTING` → `CS_EXECUTE` → 媒体或挂断 `CS_HANGUP` → "
"`CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY`（`src/include/switch_types.h`）。"

