#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:70
#: 164b291d5b1844dea2f2c13ec5e90624
msgid ""
"**Parse process options.** `main()` starts with core flags for SQL "
"scoreboard, automatic NAT detection / port mapping, clock calibration, "
"and realtime clock. Options such as `-nosql`, `-nonat`, `-nonatmap`, "
"`-nc`, `-ncwait`, `-c`, `-conf`, `-log`, `-run`, and `-mod` modify those "
"flags or global directories. `FREESWITCH_OPTS` is appended to the "
"command-line arguments before parsing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:71
#: 9226ac600c194bceb011e6d1f62338e7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Initialize the process runtime.** APR is initialized before the core. "
"`switch_core_set_globals()` resolves the base, configuration, module, "
"log, run, database, and related directories. The process creates or locks"
" `${run_dir}/freeswitch.pid`; a second process using the same run "
"directory exits instead of starting a duplicate server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:72
#: 39a35edcfe634b1ca534e8da6b10d80c
msgid ""
"**Choose foreground or background mode.** `-c` passes `console=true` and "
"enters the interactive console loop. `-nc` backgrounds without waiting. "
"`-ncwait` backgrounds and uses a pipe so the parent waits until "
"initialization succeeds or fails. `-nonat` removes `SCF_USE_AUTO_NAT`; it"
" does not disable SIP or RTP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:73
#: c3f139e122404ee0ab25ecd3fde8dc05
msgid ""
"**Apply process controls.** Signal handlers are installed for shutdown, "
"optional priority is selected (`-rp`, `-lp`, or `-np`), resource limits "
"are set, and `-u` / `-g` can drop to the requested user and group before "
"core initialization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:74
#: 4dd2eeb5f6f34c77a393cf643d8e415e
msgid ""
"**Initialize the core.** `switch_core_init()` resets runtime state, "
"initializes SQLite, APR-backed memory pools, core session structures, "
"global events, MIME types, console, event engine, and channel globals. It"
" creates the configured directories and sets global variables such as "
"`conf_dir`, `log_dir`, `run_dir`, and `mod_dir`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:75
#: b8f289525b88446fabfc8010e63f2d84
msgid ""
"**Load the root configuration.** `switch_xml_init()` parses the "
"configured `freeswitch.xml` and its preprocessor includes. Unless "
"`SCF_MINIMAL` is set, `switch_core_init()` then loads `switch.conf`, "
"initializes the state machine and media layer, starts the scheduler task "
"thread, performs late NAT initialization, initializes RTP, and schedules "
"heartbeat / IP-check tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:76
#: c9e66e63a9d7419fb0634978acfb942b
msgid ""
"**Load modules in dependency order.** `switch_loadable_module_init()` "
"first prepares the module registries and loads core modules. It then "
"reads `pre_load_modules.conf.xml`, starts the core SQL scoreboard, "
"releases module-load events held until SQL is ready, reads "
"`modules.conf.xml` and `post_load_modules.conf.xml`, and finally starts "
"module runtime threads. A `critical=\"true\"` module failure aborts "
"startup. How each `<load>` tag is located and executed: [Runtime load tag"
"](#runtime-load-tag)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:77
#: 1b54c84a7e464cb388100d5d678af4d5
msgid ""
"**Publish readiness.** `switch_core_init_and_modload()` logs `Bringing up"
" environment.` and `Loading Modules.`, fires `SWITCH_EVENT_STARTUP` with "
"`Event-Info: System Ready`, prints the banner and startup summary, "
"executes the optional `api_on_startup` command, and clears "
"`SCF_NO_NEW_SESSIONS`. With systemd support it also sends `READY=1`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:78
#: 0eee47b579cf4a3fa04e317c74216f56
msgid ""
"**Enter the runtime loop.** `switch_core_runtime_loop(nc)` waits on "
"`runtime.running` in background mode or reads console input in foreground"
" mode. `-ncwait` reports readiness to its parent only after the "
"initialization function returns successfully."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:79
#: abf5e1d9e7194be883abdbece231242a
msgid ""
"**Shutdown and cleanup.** SIGTERM / console shutdown leaves the runtime "
"loop, calls `switch_core_destroy()`, marks the runtime as shutting down, "
"rejects new sessions, hangs up existing sessions, shuts down modules and "
"event / XML / RTP services, closes the PID file, removes it, and "
"optionally re-execs when the result is `SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART`."
msgstr ""

