#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:271
#: 17305dda1a884bb89d03fb66b2d28e0a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: a SIP `INVITE` datagram or TCP segment arrives on a Sofia "
"profile bind (vanilla internal typically UDP/TCP **5060**, external "
"**5080**). The kernel delivers it to a socket owned by Sofia-SIP "
"**tport**, not by `libfreeswitch`. After parse and transaction matching, "
"NUA delivers `nua_i_invite` to `sofia_event_callback()` in "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia.c` on the **profile** thread."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：SIP `INVITE` 到达 Sofia 配置档（vanilla 内部通常为 UDP/TCP **5060**，外部为 "
"**5080**）。Sofia-SIP 将 `nua_i_invite` 投递给 "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia.c` 中的 `sofia_event_callback()`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:272
#: 5f8638ab0b36495b88c553a2d2845ba8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Goal**: allocate a session/channel, authenticate if the profile "
"requires it, hunt an XML extension, run applications (vanilla "
"`Local_Extension` bridges `user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`), "
"exchange media, then hang up with a SIP response/`BYE`/`CANCEL` and "
"CDR/events."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：分配会话/通道，若配置档要求则鉴权，查找 XML extension，运行应用（vanilla 的 "
"`Local_Extension` 会 bridge "
"`user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`），交换媒体，然后以 SIP 响应/`BYE`/`CANCEL`"
" 挂断并产生 CDR/事件。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:274
#: dbb83eacea7b42f9a7bdb7423bc4d84e
