#: 34ab3a9826664896afd1662e995881e2
msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH never `recv()`s SIP on the session thread. Each profile thread"
" creates `su_root_t`, calls `nua_create(..., sofia_event_callback, "
"profile, NUTAG_URL(profile->bindurl), ...)`, then loops `su_root_step()`."
" `config_sofia_profile_urls()` builds `bindurl` as `sip:<user>@<sip-ip"
">:<sip-port>` plus `transport=udp,tcp` unless `bind-params` override it "
"(`sofia.c`). TLS/WS/WSS are extra `NUTAG_SIPS_URL` / `NUTAG_WS_URL` / "
"`NUTAG_WSS_URL` binds."
msgstr ""

