msgid ""
"`sofia_event_callback` admits the request on the profile thread "
"(503/422), then `nua_save_event` into `sofia_dispatch_event_t` so NUA can"
" free the stack event. A **new** INVITE allocates "
"`switch_core_session_request`, `sofia_glue_attach_private`, launches the "
"session thread in `CS_NEW`, and `switch_core_session_queue_signal_data`. "
"`sofia_handle_sip_i_invite` runs later on the **session** thread via "
"`sofia_process_dispatch_event` → `our_sofia_event_callback`. Follow-up "
"SIP on the same `nua_handle` (re-INVITE, BYE, `nua_i_state`) also uses "
"`signal_data_queue`. REGISTER without a session uses "
"`sofia_queue_message`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:310
#: 67c1bf32763240f4ae1fc00a5444e94a
msgid "Session-timer admission (RFC 4028)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:312
#: c46debe1c68f4146b6a0caa1d23344f9
msgid ""
"Before queueing an incoming INVITE, `sofia_event_callback()` checks the "
"request's `Session-Expires` against the profile's `minimum-session-"
"expires` setting "
"([`sofia.c:2450-2459`](https://github.com/signalwire/freeswitch/tree/master/src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia.c))."
" `sip->sip_session_expires->x_delta` is the requested interval in "
"seconds. If it is below the configured minimum, FreeSWITCH sends:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:323
#: 6050c6e7e62b4ac5ad06f8b8c8b43c89
msgid ""
"The `goto end` skips event allocation and queueing, so the rejected "
"INVITE is not admitted as a call. If the interval is equal to or greater "
"than the local minimum, this guard does nothing and normal INVITE "
"processing continues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:327
#: 2ba3a50e38ce45e38d6126e43bacad5f
msgid "`Session-Expires` and `Min-SE` have different meanings:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:329
#: 465d743d81f2471ab7245c75d84c1240
msgid "`Session-Expires` is the requested maximum time between session refreshes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:330
#: 60542f459af3424b896410cf269df0b6
msgid "`Min-SE` is the lower bound that an element is willing to accept."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:332
#: 392f578b44644c9399c225da2cf68019
msgid ""
"Therefore this code compares `Session-Expires` with the local minimum; it"
" does not compare the peer's `Min-SE` value. The profile value is parsed "
"from `minimum-session-expires` and values below 90 seconds are raised to "
"90, in accordance with RFC 4028. The same value is passed to Sofia-SIP "
"with `NUTAG_MIN_SE` when session timers are configured "
"([`sofia.c:3355-3356`](https://github.com/signalwire/freeswitch/tree/master/src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia.c))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:338
#: 5c894513d9e34076b723207a867ad14a
msgid ""
"RFC 4028 defines `Session-Expires`, `Min-SE`, and response code 422. A "
"UAS or proxy may reject an INVITE whose session interval is below its "
"local policy; the 422 response must contain `Min-SE` with that policy "
"value. The minimum is 90 seconds, and a successful 2xx response carries "
"the negotiated `Session-Expires` and identifies the refresher (`uac` or "
"`uas`). The refresher typically sends a re-INVITE or UPDATE before "
"expiry; this code covers only the early admission/rejection step, not the"
" later refresh transaction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:346
#: 379164d20e09486cb4fcb0c2808a284e
msgid ""
"For example, with `minimum-session-expires=120`, an INVITE containing "
"`Session-Expires: 60` receives 422 and `Min-SE: 120`; the caller should "
"retry with an interval of at least 120 seconds. This block does not "
"reject an INVITE that has no `Session-Expires` header. RFC 4028 also "
"discusses the `Supported: timer` capability negotiation; this local guard"
" itself checks the presence and value of `Session-Expires`, but does not "
"explicitly inspect `Supported`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:353
#: efdbc71049624f92b0c3637379da0d52
msgid ""
"See [RFC 4028](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4028.html), especially "
"Sections 4–6 and 9."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:356
#: daeeea2c5e6849c1ba310f1580fd7003
msgid ""
"Digest **401** then a second INVITE with `Authorization` is often **one**"
" session UUID: the first callback may detach the handle and store Call-ID"
" in `profile->chat_hash`; the authenticated INVITE re-attaches (`Re-"
"attaching to session`). Siptrace shows two INVITEs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:358
#: 1c9839439e5a4279865c095720b50575
msgid ""
"Session threads send SIP only through `nua_respond` / `nua_bye` / "
"`nua_invite`; tport `send` still runs on the profile `su_root`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:401
#: ae7a8af49c2a4d1d8a0d152d7274739f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Admit the INVITE.** `sofia_event_callback()` rejects with **503** "
"`\"Maximum Calls In Progress\"` / `\"System Busy\"` / `\"System Paused\"`"
" when session limit, message-queue critical watermark, or `PFLAG_STANDBY`"
" is hit. Missing `Call-ID` → **503** `\"INVALID INVITE\"`. An incoming "
"`Session-Expires` below the profile's `minimum-session-expires` → **422**"
" with `Min-SE`."
msgstr ""
"**准入 INVITE。** 当命中会话上限、消息队列临界水位或 `PFLAG_STANDBY` "
"时，`sofia_event_callback()` 以 **503** `\"Maximum Calls In Progress\"` / "
"`\"System Busy\"` / `\"System Paused\"` 拒绝。缺少 `Call-ID` → **503** "
"`\"INVALID INVITE\"`。会话定时器 `Min-SE` 过小 → **422**。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:402
#: 7ed8374fe92749e7bbc81e66f9a5ddbe
msgid ""
"**Create the inbound session.** `switch_core_session_request()` (or "
"`switch_core_session_request_uuid()` when `PFLAG_CALLID_AS_UUID`) plus "
"`sofia_glue_new_pvt()` / `sofia_glue_attach_private()`. The event is "
"queued onto the session with `switch_core_session_queue_signal_data()`; "
"the session thread starts in `CS_NEW`."
msgstr ""
"**创建呼入会话。** `switch_core_session_request()`（当 `PFLAG_CALLID_AS_UUID` 时为 "
"`switch_core_session_request_uuid()`），再加上 `sofia_glue_new_pvt()` / "
"`sofia_glue_attach_private()`。事件通过 "
"`switch_core_session_queue_signal_data()` 入队到该会话；会话线程从 `CS_NEW` 启动。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:403
#: 37dc3eeb3625495baeec177720b56c60
msgid ""
"**Handle the INVITE body.** `sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()` requires a "
"`Contact` (**400** `\"Missing Contact Header\"` otherwise). Source "
"IP/port become `sip_network_ip` / `sip_network_port`. Destination number "
"is Request-URI user (`req_user`), or the full URI when `full-id-in-"
"dialplan` (`PFLAG_FULL_ID`)."
msgstr ""
"**处理 INVITE 消息体。** `sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()` 要求有 `Contact`（否则 **400**"
" `\"Missing Contact Header\"`）。源 IP/端口成为 `sip_network_ip` / "
"`sip_network_port`。被叫号码是 Request-URI 的 user（`req_user`），或在 `full-id-in-"
"dialplan`（`PFLAG_FULL_ID`）时为完整 URI。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:404
#: 3b5fdab5e372496e95f7565e654e3134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Authenticate when required.** Vanilla internal profile: `auth-"
"calls=$${internal_auth_calls}` (`true` in `conf/vanilla/vars.xml`) and "
"`apply-inbound-acl` = `domains`. Failed ACL can fall back to Digest. "
"Digest uses the same `sofia_reg_handle_register(..., REG_INVITE, ...)` "
"path as REGISTER. Success sets `sip_authorized=true` and loads directory "
"XML via `switch_ivr_set_user_xml()` (including `user_context`). External "
"profile: `auth-calls=false` — typically no digest; context stays the "
"profile context (`public`)."
msgstr ""
"**需要时鉴权。** Vanilla 内部配置档：`auth-"
"calls=$${internal_auth_calls}`（`conf/vanilla/vars.xml` 中为 `true`）且 "
"`apply-inbound-acl` = `domains`。ACL 失败可回退到 Digest。Digest 走与 REGISTER 相同的 "
"`sofia_reg_handle_register(..., REG_INVITE, ...)` 路径。成功后设置 "
"`sip_authorized=true`，并通过 `switch_ivr_set_user_xml()` 加载 directory XML（含 "
"`user_context`）。外部配置档：`auth-calls=false` — 通常不做 "
"digest；上下文保持为配置档上下文（`public`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:405
#: 4b21cabecfef469f8af3a29802390f32
msgid ""
"**Build the caller profile.** Context order in "
"`sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()`: ACL override → channel `user_context` → "
"profile `context` (or From-host when profile context is `_domain_`). "
"Dialplan defaults to profile `dialplan` (`XML`) unless `inbound_dialplan`"
" is set."
msgstr ""
"**构建 caller profile。** `sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()` 中的 context 顺序：ACL 覆盖"
" → 通道 `user_context` → 配置档 `context`（当配置档 context 为 `_domain_` 时用 From-"
"host）。除非设置了 `inbound_dialplan`，dialplan 默认为配置档 `dialplan`（`XML`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:406
#: 76620bcbfced4bc39264d1869c17da2c
msgid ""
"**Leave `CS_NEW`.** `sofia_handle_sip_i_state()` on "
"`nua_callstate_received` sets `CS_INIT` after SDP offer handling "
"(`sofia_media_negotiate_sdp` unless proxy/late-neg). `STATE_MACRO(init)` "
"runs `sofia_on_init` then, if the endpoint returns "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`, `switch_core_standard_on_init()` (moves to "
"`CS_ROUTING`, or `CS_EXECUTE` when `CF_RECOVERING`). After that macro, "
"the `CS_INIT` case fires `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_CREATE`."
msgstr ""
"**离开 `CS_NEW`。** `sofia_handle_sip_i_state()` 在 `nua_callstate_received` "
"时，于 SDP offer 处理之后（除非 proxy/late-neg，否则走 `sofia_media_negotiate_sdp`）设置 "
"`CS_INIT`。`STATE_MACRO(init)` 先运行 `sofia_on_init`，若 endpoint 返回 "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`，再运行 `switch_core_standard_on_init()`（进入 "
"`CS_ROUTING`，若 `CF_RECOVERING` 则进入 `CS_EXECUTE`）。该宏之后，`CS_INIT` 分支会触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_CREATE`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:407
#: b3b2643f16fb424c8e7cb7810e3b8fd3
msgid ""
"**Optional 100 Trying.** `sofia_on_routing()` sends `SIP_100_TRYING` when"
" `PFLAG_AUTO_INVITE_100` and the inbound channel is not yet answered "
"(`sofia_acknowledge_call()`)."
msgstr ""
"**可选的 100 Trying。** 当 `PFLAG_AUTO_INVITE_100` "
"且呼入通道尚未应答时，`sofia_on_routing()` 发送 "
"`SIP_100_TRYING`（`sofia_acknowledge_call()`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:408
#: 00d190be62164568a3b6b72c68243805
msgid ""
"**Hunt the dialplan.** `switch_core_standard_on_routing()` looks up "
"`caller_profile->dialplan` (comma-separated names) and calls "
"`hunt_function`. `mod_dialplan_xml` registers name `\"XML\"` → "
"`dialplan_hunt()`. Hunt locates `<context name=\"...\">` (fallback "
"`global`), walks `<extension>` / `<condition>` regexes (`parse_exten`). "
"Vanilla authenticated users (`user_context=default`) match "
"`Local_Extension` `^(10[01][0-9])$` in "
"`conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml`."
msgstr ""
"**查找 dialplan。** `switch_core_standard_on_routing()` 查找 "
"`caller_profile->dialplan`（逗号分隔的名称）并调用 `hunt_function`。`mod_dialplan_xml`"
" 将名称 `\"XML\"` 注册为 `dialplan_hunt()`。查找定位 `<context name=\"...\">`（回退 "
"`global`），遍历 `<extension>` / `<condition>` 正则（`parse_exten`）。Vanilla "
"已鉴权用户（`user_context=default`）匹配 `conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml` 中的 "
"`Local_Extension` `^(10[01][0-9])$`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:409
#: 8689879311f04efebebe7573a8cdf39c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Execute applications.** `switch_core_standard_on_execute()` walks "
"`extension->current_application` and "
"`switch_core_session_execute_application()`. Vanilla `Local_Extension` "
"sets `hangup_after_bridge=true` / `continue_on_fail=true`, then `bridge` "
"`user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`. `audio_bridge_function()` "
"calls `switch_ivr_originate()` for the B-leg, then "
"`switch_ivr_multi_threaded_bridge()` (or `switch_ivr_signal_bridge()` "
"when `CF_PROXY_MODE`). Failed originate can fall through to voicemail via"
" `loopback/app=voicemail:...`."
msgstr ""
"**执行应用。** `switch_core_standard_on_execute()` 遍历 "
"`extension->current_application` 并调用 "
"`switch_core_session_execute_application()`。Vanilla 的 `Local_Extension` "
"设置 `hangup_after_bridge=true` / `continue_on_fail=true`，然后 `bridge` "
"`user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`。`audio_bridge_function()` 为 "
"B-leg 调用 `switch_ivr_originate()`，再调用 "
"`switch_ivr_multi_threaded_bridge()`（`CF_PROXY_MODE` 时为 "
"`switch_ivr_signal_bridge()`）。originate 失败可通过 "
"`loopback/app=voicemail:...` 落到语音信箱。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:410
#: 8ce5e55fdd104480ae79015f1b83af30
msgid ""
"**Hang up.** `switch_channel_hangup()` fires "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_HANGUP` (`src/switch_channel.c`). Session thread "
"`CS_HANGUP` → `sofia_on_hangup()`: answered → `nua_bye`; unanswered "
"outbound → `nua_cancel`; unanswered inbound → `nua_respond` with "
"`hangup_cause_to_sip()`. Then `CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY`. Vanilla CDR "
"is `mod_cdr_csv`, not core SQL."
msgstr ""
"**挂断。** `switch_channel_hangup()` 触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_HANGUP`（`src/switch_channel.c`）。会话线程 `CS_HANGUP` → "
"`sofia_on_hangup()`：已应答 → `nua_bye`；未应答的呼出 → `nua_cancel`；未应答的呼入 → 以 "
"`hangup_cause_to_sip()` 做 `nua_respond`。然后 `CS_REPORTING` → "
"`CS_DESTROY`。Vanilla CDR 由 `mod_cdr_csv` 产生，而非核心 SQL。"

