#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:605
#: 3b1b8dc7ed62431d921006a55da754f1
msgid ""
"Before `switch_rtp_write_frame()`, the core may encode, transcode, "
