"This is a normal two-leg **bridge**: 1002 inbound → `bridge user/1001@…` "
"→ FreeSWITCH originates to 1001’s current registration (here a WebRTC "
"Contact). Use `uuid` for logs and `uuid_*` APIs; use `call_uuid` to group"
" legs. SIP `Call-ID` is not this CSV."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:708
#: 7b5fbfec953748c88568ca9d7a882b8f
msgid "SIP Registration and Directory Lookup"
msgstr "SIP 注册与 Directory 查找"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:712
#: 6926ff4c47ea492d81c3884d2207200b
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: SIP `REGISTER` on a Sofia profile (`nua_i_register` → "
"`sofia_reg_handle_sip_i_register()` in "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia_reg.c`). Directory lookup is also used"
" for INVITE digest (`REG_INVITE`) and Verto login."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：Sofia 配置档上的 SIP `REGISTER`（`nua_i_register` → "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia_reg.c` 中的 "
"`sofia_reg_handle_sip_i_register()`）。Directory 查找也用于 INVITE "
"digest（`REG_INVITE`）和 Verto 登录。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:713
#: 82966fe48dfa40f8ac4213d94bd942bf
msgid ""
"**Goal**: locate `user@domain` in the XML `directory` section, complete "
"Digest (unless ACL/blind-reg), persist the Contact in Sofia "
"`sip_registrations` and core `registrations`, answer **200 OK**, fire "
"`CUSTOM sofia::register`."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：在 XML `directory` 段中定位 `user@domain`，完成 Digest（除非 ACL/blind-reg），将"
" Contact 持久化到 Sofia `sip_registrations` 和核心 `registrations`，应答 **200 "
"OK**，触发 `CUSTOM sofia::register`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:715
#: 0480d07013cd415fa0ee2978a4a6b650
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Vanilla directory: domain `$${domain}` in "
"`conf/vanilla/directory/default.xml`, users `1000`–`1019` under "
"`conf/vanilla/directory/default/*.xml`. Password is "
"`$${default_password}`. Domain for REGISTER is the To/From host unless "
"the profile sets `reg-domain`."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla directory：`conf/vanilla/directory/default.xml` 中的域 "
"`$${domain}`，用户 `1000`–`1019` 位于 "
"`conf/vanilla/directory/default/*.xml`。密码为 "
"`$${default_password}`。REGISTER 的域是 To/From host，除非配置档设置了 `reg-domain`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:750
#: e9ca7394ec59441fb2c88bbf15092070
msgid ""
"**Profile gates.** If the profile lacks `MFLAG_REGISTER`, respond "
"**403**. Optional `apply-register-acl`: reject IP → **403**; pass without"
" `PFLAG_BLIND_REG` → `REG_AUTO_REGISTER` (skip digest). Vanilla internal "
"has `apply-register-acl` commented out."
msgstr ""
"**配置档门禁。** 若配置档缺少 `MFLAG_REGISTER`，应答 **403**。可选 `apply-register-acl`：拒绝 "
"IP → **403**；通过且无 `PFLAG_BLIND_REG` → `REG_AUTO_REGISTER`（跳过 "
"digest）。Vanilla 内部配置档中 `apply-register-acl` 被注释掉。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:751
#: e492c0320c4f4a6192c96fcecab566b7
msgid ""
"**Missing Contact.** With `reg_deny_binding_fetch_and_no_lookup`, no "
"Contact → **400**. Otherwise a fetch-style REGISTER may proceed without "
"adding a binding."
msgstr ""
"**缺少 Contact。** 若启用 `reg_deny_binding_fetch_and_no_lookup`，无 Contact → "
"**400**。否则 fetch 式 REGISTER 可不添加绑定而继续。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:752
#: 15f5116c51854e4e81ff6ae5acfb6e58
msgid ""
"**Challenge.** No `Authorization` (and not auto/blind) → "
"`sofia_reg_auth_challenge()` inserts a nonce into `sip_authentication` "
"and sends **401** `Digest realm=..., nonce=..., algorithm=MD5, "
"qop=\"auth\"` (RFC 8760 extra algorithms when configured)."
msgstr ""
"**质询。** 无 `Authorization`（且非 auto/blind）→ `sofia_reg_auth_challenge()` 向 "
"`sip_authentication` 插入 nonce，并发送 **401** `Digest realm=..., nonce=..., "
"algorithm=MD5, qop=\"auth\"`（配置时还有 RFC 8760 额外算法）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:753
#: 11fd0c90836e43a5be16d58829e4b70a
msgid ""
"**Locate the user.** `sofia_reg_parse_auth()` calls "
"`switch_xml_locate_user_merged(\"id\", username, domain_name, ip, ...)`. "
"Domain is `profile->reg_domain` if set, else Digest realm. Pointer users "
"(`type=\"pointer\"` in group XML) cannot register. Missing user → "
"`AUTH_FORBIDDEN` and the log line that the domain/user must exist in "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"**定位用户。** `sofia_reg_parse_auth()` 调用 "
"`switch_xml_locate_user_merged(\"id\", username, domain_name, ip, "
"...)`。域为已设置的 `profile->reg_domain`，否则为 Digest realm。指针用户（组 XML 中 "
"`type=\"pointer\"`）不能注册。用户不存在 → `AUTH_FORBIDDEN`，并记录 domain/user 必须存在于 "
"directory 的日志行。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:754
#: 06d9800556214a31915e589869e6c89d
msgid ""
"**Verify Digest.** Directory `<param name=\"password\">` or `a1-hash`. "
"`sip-forbid-register=true` forbids. Per-user `auth-acl` can still reject "
"the source IP. Results: `AUTH_OK`, `AUTH_RENEWED`, `AUTH_STALE` (re-"
"challenge), `AUTH_FORBIDDEN`."
msgstr ""
"**校验 Digest。** Directory 的 `<param name=\"password\">` 或 `a1-hash`。`sip-"
"forbid-register=true` 会禁止。每用户 `auth-acl` 仍可拒绝源 "
"IP。结果：`AUTH_OK`、`AUTH_RENEWED`、`AUTH_STALE`（重新质询）、`AUTH_FORBIDDEN`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:755
#: 9fba8e0c13d44af8a7b05f239d775d22
msgid ""
"**Store the binding.** `insert into sip_registrations` (or `update` on "
"refresh) in `sofia_reg.c`; `switch_core_add_registration()` writes the "
"core `registrations` table. Expires 0 deletes "
"(`switch_core_del_registration`) and fires `CUSTOM sofia::unregister`."
msgstr ""
"**存储绑定。** 在 `sofia_reg.c` 中 `insert into sip_registrations`（刷新时 "
"`update`）；`switch_core_add_registration()` 写入核心 `registrations` 表。Expires"
" 0 删除（`switch_core_del_registration`）并触发 `CUSTOM sofia::unregister`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:756
#: d944d3423b3d40d5bc4c6f38eaa6169b
msgid ""
"**Respond and notify.** **200 OK** with Contact list from positive-"
"expires bindings. Fire `CUSTOM sofia::register` (`MY_EVENT_REGISTER`). "
"Attempts also fire `sofia::register_attempt` with `auth-result` `SUCCESS`"
" / `RENEWED` / `STALE` / `FORBIDDEN`."
msgstr ""
"**应答并通知。** **200 OK** 带正 Expires 绑定的 Contact 列表。触发 `CUSTOM "
"sofia::register`（`MY_EVENT_REGISTER`）。尝试还会触发带 `auth-result` `SUCCESS` / "
"`RENEWED` / `STALE` / `FORBIDDEN` 的 `sofia::register_attempt`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:757
#: 400b48a33e624432a8d672877d78ad15
msgid ""
"**INVITE reuse.** Inbound INVITE with `PFLAG_AUTH_CALLS` calls the same "
"`sofia_reg_handle_register(..., REG_INVITE, ...)` using `Proxy-"
"Authorization` / `Authorization`, then copies directory variables onto "
"the channel."
msgstr ""
"**INVITE 复用。** 带 `PFLAG_AUTH_CALLS` 的呼入 INVITE 走同一条 "
"`sofia_reg_handle_register(..., REG_INVITE, ...)` 路径，使用 `Proxy-"
"Authorization` / `Authorization`，然后将 directory 变量复制到通道。"

