#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:927
#: 1d73cfa1ac854a42b6683a07c5b0f352
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: TCP client (`fs_cli` or custom `libs/esl`) connects to "
"`mod_event_socket`. Vanilla listen: port **8021**, password "
"**`ClueCon`**, `listen-ip` **`::`** in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`. `fs_cli` itself "
"defaults to **`127.0.0.1:8021`** / `ClueCon` (`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`). If "
"`apply-inbound-acl` is unset, `config()` still applies "
"**`loopback.auto`** before any `auth/request`."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：TCP 客户端（`fs_cli` 或自定义 `libs/esl`）连接到 `mod_event_socket`。Vanilla "
"监听：端口 **8021**，密码 **`ClueCon`**，`listen-ip` **`::`**，见 "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`。`fs_cli` 自身默认 "
"**`127.0.0.1:8021`** / `ClueCon`（`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:928
#: 0eea4396cd0649e2b5101f1fc19c20ef
msgid ""
"**Goal**: authenticate, then run console APIs (`api` / `bgapi`, including"
" `originate`), subscribe to events, and/or drive a live UUID with "
"`sendmsg` (`call-command: execute|hangup|…`). Outbound mode: dialplan app"
" `socket` connects **from** FreeSWITCH to a controller."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：鉴权，然后运行控制台 API（`api` / `bgapi`，包括 `originate`），订阅事件，和/或用 `sendmsg"
"`（`call-command: execute|hangup|…`）驱动活动 UUID。呼出模式：dialplan 应用 `socket` "
"**从** FreeSWITCH 连到控制器。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:930
#: 6f33980c63e748e4bad331d25d604b5c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For production, bind ESL to loopback or a trusted management network, set"
" `apply-inbound-acl` to an explicit list (commented-out is **not** “no "
"ACL”), and replace `ClueCon`; the vanilla `listen-ip` is `::` (wildcard "
"IPv6, with IPv4 behavior dependent on the host socket settings). Remote "
"`fs_cli`: [Remote Event Socket ACL](../5.operations/01-runbook.md#remote-"
"event-socket-acl). **[NEEDS INPUT: site ESL bind, ACL CIDR, and "
"password]**."
msgstr ""
"生产环境应将 ESL 绑定到 loopback 或可信管理网络，启用入站 ACL 并替换 `ClueCon`；vanilla 的 `listen-"
"ip` 为 `::`（通配 IPv6，IPv4 行为取决于主机套接字设置）。**[NEEDS INPUT: 站点 ESL 绑定地址和密码]**。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:976
#: 415a301534714c3fa61703984993c870
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**ACL, then challenge.** If `prefs.acl_count` is set (including the "
"`loopback.auto` default), `switch_check_network_list_ip()` runs on "
"`listener->remote_ip` **before** `auth/request`. A miss sends `Content-"
"Type: text/rude-rejection` / `Access Denied, go away.` and closes the "
"socket — `fs_cli` reports `Error Connecting []`. On allow, the listener "
"sends `Content-Type: auth/request`. Until `LFLAG_AUTHED`, only `auth "
"<password>` (compared to `prefs.password`) or `userauth user@domain:pass`"
" (directory `esl-password` / `esl-allowed-api` / `esl-allowed-events`) "
"are accepted. Wrong password: `-ERR invalid` and the socket is closed."
msgstr ""
"**接受并质询。** 监听线程发送 `Content-Type: auth/request`。在 `LFLAG_AUTHED` 之前，只接受 "
"`auth <password>`（与 `prefs.password` 比较）或 `userauth "
"user@domain:pass`（directory 的 `esl-password` / `esl-allowed-api` / `esl-"
"allowed-events`）。密码错误：`-ERR invalid` 并关闭套接字。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:977
#: 8255b55d002c4776b0d55687532a2c94
msgid ""
"**Parse commands.** `parse_command()` in `mod_event_socket.c`. After "
"auth: `api`, `bgapi` (async + `Job-UUID` + `BACKGROUND_JOB`), `event` / "
"`nixevent` / `noevents` / `myevents`, `sendmsg`, `sendevent`, `getvar`, "
"`log`, `linger`, `exit` (`+OK bye`). Replies are `+OK` or `-ERR`."
msgstr ""
"**解析命令。** `mod_event_socket.c` 中的 `parse_command()`。鉴权后：`api`、`bgapi`（异步 "
"+ `Job-UUID` + `BACKGROUND_JOB`）、`event` / `nixevent` / `noevents` / "
"`myevents`、`sendmsg`、`sendevent`、`getvar`、`log`、`linger`、`exit`（`+OK "
"bye`）。回复为 `+OK` 或 `-ERR`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:978
#: 2455558d5fb34f8bbd9ec9e114fb2368
msgid ""
"**`api originate`.** `originate_function` in `mod_commands.c`. Syntax: "
"`<call url> <exten>|&<application_name>(<app_args>) [<dialplan>] "
"[<context>] [<cid_name>] [<cid_num>] [<timeout_sec>]`. Defaults: dialplan"
" `XML`, context `default`, timeout **60s**. Calls "
"`switch_ivr_originate()`. On success the new session is transferred into "
"the extension or `&app(args)` inline extension; on failure `-ERR` plus "
"`switch_channel_cause2str(cause)`."
msgstr ""
"**`api originate`。** `mod_commands.c` 中的 `originate_function`。语法：`<call "
"url> <exten>|&<application_name>(<app_args>) [<dialplan>] [<context>] "
"[<cid_name>] [<cid_num>] [<timeout_sec>]`。默认：dialplan `XML`，context "
"`default`，超时 **60s**。调用 `switch_ivr_originate()`。成功时新会话转入 extension 或 "
"`&app(args)` 内联 extension；失败则 `-ERR` 加上 "
"`switch_channel_cause2str(cause)`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:979
#: a82bcc2766a84581bc5d9fbb26724fcd
msgid ""
"**Outbound SIP leg.** `sofia_outgoing_channel()` sets `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` "
"and `CS_INIT`. `sofia_on_init()` then `sofia_glue_do_invite()` sends the "
"INVITE. Core also fires `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_ORIGINATE` for outbound "
"legs."
msgstr ""
"**呼出 SIP 腿。** `sofia_outgoing_channel()` 设置 `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` 和 "
"`CS_INIT`。随后 `sofia_on_init()` 再由 `sofia_glue_do_invite()` 发送 "
"INVITE。核心还会为呼出腿触发 `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_ORIGINATE`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:980
#: 58d893e17cd44f169fbc167e008d2dd7
msgid ""
"**`sendmsg`.** Headers include `call-command`. `switch_ivr_parse_event()`"
" hashes `execute` (needs `execute-app-name` / `execute-app-arg`), "
"`hangup`, `nomedia`, `unicast`, `xferext`. With a UUID, the event is "
"queued on that session (`switch_core_session_queue_private_event`); "
"outbound `socket` sessions may run it inline."
msgstr ""
"**`sendmsg`。** 头字段包含 `call-command`。`switch_ivr_parse_event()` 哈希 "
"`execute`（需要 `execute-app-name` / `execute-app-"
"arg`）、`hangup`、`nomedia`、`unicast`、`xferext`。有 UUID "
"时事件入队到该会话（`switch_core_session_queue_private_event`）；呼出 `socket` 会话可内联执行。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:981
#: 0ed147fe6f70474cbde2357acd36651f
msgid ""
"**Outbound ESL (`socket` app).** `SWITCH_ADD_APP(..., \"socket\", ..., "
"socket_function, \"<ip>[:<port>]\")`. The channel connects out; the "
"controller sends the same `sendmsg` vocabulary. `LFLAG_OUTBOUND` without "
"`LFLAG_FULL` skips inbound-only commands (`api`, `sendevent`, …)."
msgstr ""
"**呼出 ESL（`socket` 应用）。** `SWITCH_ADD_APP(..., \"socket\", ..., "
"socket_function, \"<ip>[:<port>]\")`。通道向外连接；控制器发送同一套 `sendmsg` "
"词汇。`LFLAG_OUTBOUND` 且无 `LFLAG_FULL` 时跳过仅呼入命令（`api`、`sendevent`、…）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:982
#: f1880d243a3e4c31a273e3661cd3a01b
msgid ""
"**Events to the client.** `mod_event_socket` binds `SWITCH_EVENT_ALL`. "
"Serialize with `switch_event_serialize()` (plain) or JSON. Do not block "
"the event thread (`switch_event.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**发给客户端的事件。** `mod_event_socket` 绑定 `SWITCH_EVENT_ALL`。用 "
"`switch_event_serialize()`（plain）或 JSON 序列化。不要阻塞事件线程（`switch_event.h`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:984
#: cc7a5323154a47e59f3c5dfd2c1e7499
