msgid "XML Reload"
msgstr "XML 重载"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1027
#: 35296bdd112940e797c3a9a1527b06d6
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: console/ESL `reloadxml` (`reload_xml_function` in "
"`mod_commands.c`), or `reloadacl` / `sofia profile <name> rescan` which "
"also call `switch_xml_reload()`."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：控制台/ESL `reloadxml`（`mod_commands.c` 中的 "
"`reload_xml_function`），或同样会调用 `switch_xml_reload()` 的 `reloadacl` / "
"`sofia profile <name> rescan`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1028
#: aba7891893c1451bbd4cc40681a7b03f
msgid ""
"**Goal**: re-parse `conf_dir` + `freeswitch.xml` (vanilla root "
"`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml` with preprocessor includes), replace "
"`MAIN_XML_ROOT`, fire `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML` so **new** dialplan hunts "
"and directory locates see the new tree. In-flight sessions keep the "
"extension they already hunted."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：重新解析 `conf_dir` + `freeswitch.xml`（vanilla 根为带预处理器 include 的 "
"`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`），替换 `MAIN_XML_ROOT`，触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`，使**新的** dialplan 查找和 directory "
"定位看到新树。进行中的会话仍保留已经查到的 extension。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1057
#: fdeab5214670488d9e2d7b4681a54990
#, python-format
msgid ""
"(`reload_xml_function` always prints `+OK [%s]` with the `err` string "
"from `switch_xml_reload` — including failure text. Check the bracketed "
"message, not only `+OK`.)"
msgstr ""
"（`reload_xml_function` 始终打印带 `switch_xml_reload` 返回的 `err` 字符串的 `+OK "
"[%s]` — 包括失败文本。请检查方括号内的消息，不要只看 `+OK`。）"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1061
#: 693a626adc504da6b40dae5025ff93d7
msgid ""
"**Re-open root.** `switch_xml_reload()` → `switch_xml_open_root(1, err)` "
"→ `__switch_xml_open_root()`. Path: `SWITCH_GLOBAL_dirs.conf_dir` + "
"`SWITCH_GLOBAL_filenames.conf_name`. Preprocessor expands `X-PRE-PROCESS`"
" / `#include` / `#set`. Flattened copy remains `freeswitch.xml.fsxml` (do"
" not edit while running)."
msgstr ""
"**重新打开 root。** `switch_xml_reload()` → `switch_xml_open_root(1, err)` → "
"`__switch_xml_open_root()`。路径：`SWITCH_GLOBAL_dirs.conf_dir` + "
"`SWITCH_GLOBAL_filenames.conf_name`。预处理器展开 `X-PRE-PROCESS` / `#include` /"
" `#set`。展平副本仍为 `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`（运行中不要编辑）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1062
#: 1c3ca303a27346f48de16046758fafc2
msgid ""
"**Commit or keep old.** Parse error: `switch_xml_error()` copied to "
"`err`, new tree discarded, previous root stays. Success: "
"`switch_xml_set_root(new_main)`, `err` = `\"Success\"`."
msgstr ""
"**提交或保留旧树。** 解析错误：`switch_xml_error()` 复制到 `err`，新树丢弃，保留原 "
"root。成功：`switch_xml_set_root(new_main)`，`err` = `\"Success\"`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1063
#: ffa6eec1abb843a595422fdebbed0bc7
msgid ""
"**Notify.** If a root is returned, `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML` is fired "
"(`switch_xml_open_root`). Modules that `switch_event_bind(..., "
"SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML, ...)` refresh themselves (examples in-tree: "
"`mod_voicemail` does not bind this id for its main config in the same "
"way; `mod_enum`, `mod_cidlookup`, `mod_loopback`, `mod_avmd`, "
"`mod_tts_commandline` do)."
msgstr ""
"**通知。** 若返回了 root，则触发 `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`（`switch_xml_open_root`）。通过"
" `switch_event_bind(..., SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML, ...)` "
"绑定的模块会自行刷新（树内示例：`mod_voicemail` 不以同样方式绑定该 id "
"来刷新主配置；`mod_enum`、`mod_cidlookup`、`mod_loopback`、`mod_avmd`、`mod_tts_commandline`"
" 会绑定）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1064
#: baa77c30f9e541c888090d4e0f8a1963
msgid ""
"**What picks up immediately.** Next `dialplan_hunt()` / "
"`switch_xml_locate_user()` reads the new root. Vanilla file users without"
" `cacheable` are re-read from XML."
msgstr ""
"**立即生效的部分。** 下一次 `dialplan_hunt()` / `switch_xml_locate_user()` 读取新 "
"root。没有 `cacheable` 的 vanilla 文件用户会从 XML 重新读取。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1065
#: 83ab489f2b1e47cfbd5c1c98b74e1161
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**What does not auto-apply.** `mod_sofia` does **not** bind "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`. `sofia profile <name> rescan` reloads supported"
" profile data and reparses gateways, domains, and aliases, but it does "
"not rebind transport sockets. Changes to `sip-ip`, `sip-port`, TLS, `ws-"
"binding`, or `wss-binding` require a profile restart or process restart. "
"ACL lists: `reloadacl` reloads XML **and** "
"`switch_load_network_lists(SWITCH_TRUE)`. Loaded DSOs: adding or removing"
" `<load>` in `modules.conf.xml` is **not** applied by `reloadxml`; use "
"`load` / `unload` / `reload` or restart. See [Runtime load tag](#runtime-"
"load-tag)."
msgstr ""
"**不会自动生效的部分。** `mod_sofia` **不会**绑定 `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`。`sofia "
"profile <name> rescan` 会重新加载支持的配置档数据并重新解析网关、域和别名，但不会重新绑定传输套接字。修改 `sip-ip"
"`、`sip-port`、TLS、`ws-binding` 或 `wss-binding` 后必须重启配置档或进程。ACL "
"列表：`reloadacl` 会重载 XML **并**调用 "
"`switch_load_network_lists(SWITCH_TRUE)`。已加载的 DSO：`reload <module>` 与 XML"
" 分开处理。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/05-workflows.md:1067
#: 0104426021b0453d9a2184a72eac70cc
msgid ""
"`mod_xml_curl` (when enabled) may replace `__switch_xml_open_root` via "
"`switch_xml_set_open_root_function()` — then “reload” is whatever that "
"hook does (HTTP fetch). **[NEEDS INPUT: whether this deploy uses "
"`mod_xml_curl` for live XML]**."
msgstr ""
"`mod_xml_curl`（启用时）可通过 `switch_xml_set_open_root_function()` 替换 "
"`__switch_xml_open_root` — 此时“reload”就是该钩子所做的事（HTTP 拉取）。**[NEEDS INPUT: "
"本次部署是否用 `mod_xml_curl` 提供实时 XML]**。"

